WEBVTT

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.110
I can't see Yano.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.610
Summer vacation is so boring.

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.780
Rehearsal!!

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:18.280
Rehearsal!!

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.790
Good morning!

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:27.840
Morning!

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.000
Everyone's already here.

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:31.010
Let's get all the desk pushed to the front.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:34.720
I wonder if Yano's in the bathroom or something...

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.970
Huh? It's from Yano.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:37.760
He can't make it today.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:39.470
Take a look.

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:42.730
Sorry. I can't make it to rehearsal today, so get some to stand in for me.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:42.730
Sorry. I can't make it to rehearsal today,
so get some to stand in for me.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.940
We can't even start without the lead! Call him back!

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.820
He must've turned off his cell phone. It's impossible.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.570
He has no sense of responsibility.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.530
Don't worry. He'll get things done when they need to be done.

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.610
That's not the real problem here...

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:58.990
Geez... and I was looking forward to today, too...

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:16.880
Why can't things go well between

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:22.850
the liar, you , and the crybaby, me?

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:28.980
You don't notice my styled hair

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:34.940
or my nice set of press-on nails.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:42.330
Love Isn't about the unhappy tears that go along with it.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:47.040
Those tears only leave my eyes dry and hurt me.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:52.960
I love this destiny

00:01:55.880 --> 00:02:01.850
between only you and only me.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:06.770
I want to accept your hot feelings

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:13.900
and be taken by you forever.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:20.660
Despite your uncute, tearful face and your shortness, I still love you.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:34.960
Episode 3 ...

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:34.960
In the end, Yano didn't come to the rehearsal after that, either...

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.220
Hello?

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.760
Ah, Mizu-chin?

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:42.890
A festival?

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.890
Yeah, I'll totally go.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.220
You're gonna wear a yukata?

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.640
I don't think I will...

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.940
I also invited Yano and the others.

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:55.690
He skips out on practice, but he always shows up at times like these...

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.240
Once he shows up, I'll really let him have it.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:02.200
Mom! Get my yukata out!

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.330
Huh? You're wearing a yukata too, Nana!

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.500
S-Sorry for being so late.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.830
Nana, you look really cute today!

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.420
Y-You think so?

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.010
Yeah! That yukata suits you surprisingly well!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.300
That color is perfect for you!

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.590
I-Is it really?

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:24.010
I borrowed it from my cousin's older sister.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.680
The pattern on mine was just too childish.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.560
Your cheeks look really cute, too!

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:29.850
It's apricot.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.350
It looks like you just got out of bath.

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:34.560
Oh! They're wearing yukatas! The yukata brigade is here!

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:34.560
The boys are here.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.610
Huh? Where's Yano?

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.280
Ah, about that... we haven't been able to reach his cell at all.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:40.530
He's not coming?

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.990
No, I think he will... but probably with his local friends.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:43.820
We might run into them.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:47.030
It'd be nice... if he makes it...

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:50.000
Huh? Takahashi, you look completely different!

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.250
That's what I was telling her! Doesn't she look good in a yukata?

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:52.790
Not at all...

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:56.170
They do say that baby-faced kids unexpectedly look good in classic Japanese clothing.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:59.460
Compared to the normal you, Takahashi, you look like a heron tonight!

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:05.010
Ah... such a waste. If only yukatas had been the school uniform, I might've been so popular...

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:09.770
Ah, geez! Yano, what are you doing?

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:14.730
Nana, they said they'd still five you one.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.730
Here you go!

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:17.020
Yay!

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:17.770
How nice!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:20.730
Nana?

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.490
Takeuchi-kun!

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:26.660
Ah, you surprised me! I wasn't sure who it was.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:27.830
It's been a while!

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:28.490
Who are you here with?

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:32.040
I'm here with some classmates. What about you, Takeuchi-kun?

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.500
Some people from my neighborhood.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.170
He's... not here.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.170
I... I wasn't implying that or anything!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:43.630
You're so innocent.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.390
Yano couldn't make it?

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.970
That guy just doesn't seem to need other people...

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.270
I can't say it very well, but...

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:56.400
...no matter how much we talk about something, he doesn't budge an inch.

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:00.400
It's like we're not reaching him or something.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:04.280
Sometimes it seems so futile...

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:07.410
I just feel like whatever we do will be useless in the end.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.120
Even though I got really excited and even wore a yukata...

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:13.370
...counted down the days to the rehearsals on my fingers...

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.000
...it all feels so useless...

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.540
Nana, want a snow cone? I'll go buy some!

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:21.840
Okay.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.470
Sorry, looks like I can't get in touch with him.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:25.510
Ah, don't worry about that.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.590
I just wanted to complain about how he skipped out on the rehearsals.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:37.480
It was... the anniversary.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.810
The day before yesterday, for Nana-san.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.320
It must be pretty harsh, don't you think?

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:51.160
I... didn't know at all...

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.830
I was just getting all festive, without knowing a thing.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.870
That's fine.

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:01.880
Having someone always excited and happy around you.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.800
As long you keep your spirits high, that's fine.

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:09.590
Me?

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.180
Catch you later.

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:18.190
You look cute in that yukata.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.990
What... can I do?

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.710
Yano

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.750
Why am I here?

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.340
I won't, after all...

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:52.050
I don't know what to say.

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:56.310
Oh, it's a stalker! She's loitering in front of my house!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:06:59.560
Yano!

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.940
I-I'm no stalker.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:03.060
That caught me off guard!

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.980
Then what are you?

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.570
How long has he been watching me?

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.360
I had some business with you!

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:10.030
Aimlessly lingering around my place?

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:11.030
No!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.450
See!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:13.320
Let me in!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.830
Sorry, I refuse degenerates.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:19.040
Y-You...! Yano, open the gate, dammit!

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.750
The female pervert stalker has gone berserk!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:24.590
Are you moron?! Mrs, Yano, I've come for a school visit with your stupid-ass son!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.050
I said open up!

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:28.840
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting...

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:31.050
Ah... the worst possible situation...

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.350
Please stay as long as you like.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:37.640
Have some.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:38.310
Ah, Yeah...

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:40.060
Thank you.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.690
I'm all alone with Yano in his room...

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.820
I-I'm getting nervous...

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.070
Takahashi, why did you come poking around here?

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:54.570
I-I th-th-thought you m-might be sick, so...

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:57.080
Why would you think I was sick?

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.740
Well, like, you've missed every rehearsal so far.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:02.040
Why didn't you just get right to the point and ask why I've missed them?

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.920
You sure are one to speak right now, since you're the one who missed them!

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.460
Why did you miss them, then?

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:07.290
Er, shoot!

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:12.050
Yano?

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:15.090
I've been drowning in my memories of Nana-san...

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:17.810
I'm no good in the summer.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.600
That's why...

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:24.770
...can I skip the rehearsal the day after tomorrow, and the one tow days after tomorrow, too?

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:28.940
You're lying.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:29.570
Damn.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.400
Why did you miss them?

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.490
It's summer break, and you expect me to wake up at nine in the morning?

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.320
T-This guy...

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:38.410
It was my own fault for worrying about you.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.290
You got to eat some bean jelly, so don't complain.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.500
It's not like I come here just to eat bean jelly!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.330
Then don't eat any!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.290
No, I'll eat some!

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.000
What the...? He's totally cheerful.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.840
Thank goodness.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:57.340
And.. I finally got to see him.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:00.100
Ah, is that a photo album?

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.100
Lemme see!

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:01.720
No.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:02.680
Why not?

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:04.440
Wait a sec. I'll take out all the bad pictures.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:05.310
What do you mean, "bad"?

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.980
Was your middle school trip to Sapporo?

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.060
Same as mine.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:17.320
Hey... can I see a picture of Nana-san?

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:20.780
What are you gonna do after looking at something like that?

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.160
Here you go.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:30.670
I'm not even sure... what I want to do after I see it.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.880
You're pretty careless, aren't you?

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.630
Do you realize where you are right now?

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:38.640
On my bed.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:42.350
B-But the door's open, so...

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:43.810
The window, too.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:44.850
People are passing by outside.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.350
An you're my classmate, Yano...

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.230
What are you doing?

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.950
I haven't done anything. She just fell on her own.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:01.580
S-Sorry for making such a fuss...

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.790
Are you a moron? Don't take me so seriously!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:08.750
Is that... is that just it?

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.500
Hey, this isn't a picture of Nana-san.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:14.210
I don't have a single picture of her.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.300
He doesn't budge an inch....

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:23.850
I thought of you every day.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:25.980
I went to rehearsal all excited.

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:28.230
I got really happy wore a yukata.

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:29.480
I even come over your house.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:33.730
But none of that seems to matter to you at all.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.240
You'd better be at rehearsal  the day after tomorrow.

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.740
That's all I could say.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:41.160
He's just another classmate.

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:41.950
Takahashi.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.990
Thanks for today.

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:46.950
I just... wanted to see you.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:48.710
Yano!

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:52.920
Yano, you may not have someone left who you really, really love...

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:55.090
...and that might be a really sad thing for you, but...

00:10:55.090 --> 00:11:00.930
...because there are people out there who really, really love you, shouldn't it all equal out?

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:05.310
So... please don't think you're all alone.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.980
I'm watching you, so..!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:11.400
I'm always watching you, so...!

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.940
I'm always watching over you, so...!

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:17.480
Sorry for having bothered you!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:25.450
I'm always watching you... I'm always watching over you.

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:28.330
So... please don't think you're all alone.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.170
Did you check on the props?

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.420
They're going pretty well so far.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.290
It's because Yamamoto-san's so reliable for things like this.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.300
And Yano?

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:38.460
He's not here again today.

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:40.340
He's just no good.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:43.260
Now that it's come to this, I'll just have to cover with my acting skills.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:44.720
It's easy to say.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:48.020
But really, nothing's changed.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:51.980
I'm... so powerless.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.150
Ah... good morning.

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:58.360
Morning.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:03.700
He... showed up.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:04.490
Nana.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:05.740
Nana, the happi coats.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:07.030
I borrowed some samples.

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.450
Witch color would be better?

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:10.120
I think red's pretty cute.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.160
Yeah, I thought so, too. Red's better, isn't it?

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.000
Yano!

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:14.880
Yeah! It really does look cute.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.380
And this way, dirt won't stand out.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.590
What's up with that?

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:18.710
Look, look!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.840
The red looks good on you.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.850
We're totally going with white.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:32.390
There's no other person who can make my heart beat this fast...

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:33.600
Is white all right?

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:38.400
The white suits you. It must be nice, Yano. Everything looks good on you.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:39.650
You looked good, too...

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.110
...in that yukata.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.860
What are you talkin--

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.830
How...?

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.580
Takeuchi sent it to me.

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:54.540
He took a pretty good picture.

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:58.540
I regretted not going.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:06.260
You said you're watching me, didn't you? Always watching me.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:07.590
Can you really do that?

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.050
I.. I can!

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:10.060
Bullshit.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.520
You're so unreasonable.

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:15.020
And what about that "it all equals out" junk? As if that logic works!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.650
You're watching over me? Spewing out a guy line like that!

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:18.560
You're really conceited, aren't you?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.770
You're so mean, saying it like that!

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:21.780
Ow.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.570
S-Sorry.

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:25.490
Yano?

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:29.580
Just kidding.

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:32.540
I was actually really happy.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.040
Nana-chan.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.340
Y-Yes?

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:42.550
Let me borrow your chest.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:51.890
I promise to always watch over you...

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:55.770
You're not alone.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:03.440
September 4th
Helpers:
Mizuguchi
Miyamoto

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.320
Summer break flew by in an instant.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:08.110
But there's been no change between me and Yano.

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:12.530
It's pretty impressive that Yano can fall asleep in a place like this.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.620
And he's using my bag as a pillow.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:17.120
I wonder if he's dreaming?

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.870
Some airheaded dream.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:23.590
I wonder what kind of dreams Yano has...

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.010
Isn't that Yamamoto's older sister?

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.550
Geh! That guy with her is Kagawa.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.600
Ah, you mean that guy who skipped out of our grade and graduated?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.230
He's always with a different girl.

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:38.640
She's really going out with a loser.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.770
He threw his water on her!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:41.360
Is that a battlefield?

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:44.900
He left...

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:45.990
He's the worst.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:49.570
Hey, you guys are in the same class as Yuri, right?

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.990
I'm sorry, but could you lend me some cash?

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:54.240
He left without paying.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.870
If you put that much Tabasco on, you'll get hemorrhoids!

00:14:58.870 --> 00:14:59.750
Hemorrhoids, huh?

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.880
You don't resemble your younger sister much, do you?

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:06.010
Ah, you think I'm some kind of idiot, don't you?

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:07.460
What's that?

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:09.430
Huh? Ah, this?

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:10.010
Did you fall?

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.850
Whenever he's in bad mood, it always turns out like this.

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:14.220
He can be such a kid at times.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.430
Your boyfriend doesn't have the best reputation, you know.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.980
But isn't he so cool?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.060
His bad parts are part of his charm.

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:24.270
There's no perfect man out there.

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.230
As long as I can understand him, that's good enough.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:28.990
They call that sort of thing "being blind."

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:31.950
You haven't really fallen in love with anyone before.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:34.450
They call people like you "immature know-it-alls."

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.950
Hurry and fall in love.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:45.630
Huh? Is Nana-san waiting for her boyfriend?

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.050
She should wait in a warmer place.

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:51.340
She has no cash. If she sees us, she'll probably try to sponge us.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.010
What do you wanna do today?

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.300
Let's go to your place, Takeuchi.

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:55.350
Ah, could I change first?

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:56.850
So cold...

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.600
Ah, the new Sunday's out!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.190
What's this? It looks so funny!

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.270
I could really laugh at this!

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:07.980
Do you still think he's gonna come?

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:09.820
He won't.

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:11.450
Then why are you waiting around?

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.110
To gather my rage.

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:13.740
Your rage...?

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:16.620
I'll gather my rage and curse him to death!

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.830
Don't underestimate women.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.830
That's not a hand warmer. it's a drink.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:39.350
He says not to talk to other guys...

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:43.520
...but if i respond with "didn't you have sex with that other girl?" things really get messed up.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.150
He completely enjoys every minute of this.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:50.280
Every time I cry, he says "I've made another girl cry" all arrogantly.

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:51.740
That jerk can just die!

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:56.240
He should fall off a bridge, break his neck, fall headfirst into a dump track and smash his head, and die!

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:57.950
Why don't you say something?

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:58.700
Huh?

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.000
You must think I'm some kind of moron, don't you?

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:05.500
Hey... what do you think I should do?

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.920
What? Figure out your own problems by yourself.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:11.760
Because I'm a moron, I don't know!

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:18.850
I could tell you, but in exchange, you better do as I say.

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:23.770
Will it make me happy?

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:27.270
What's happiness?

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:30.570
I don't know.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:34.990
Probably something where no ones cries or gets yelled at.

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.610
Where no one gets hit or has stuff thrown at them.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:38.910
Something like that.

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.450
Am I wrong?

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:41.490
I don't know.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.830
What's up with that!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:48.790
Then.. why don't we both go searching for our own happiness?

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:53.170
Hey! That's a bean jelly bun! Trade with me?

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:53.840
No.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.170
Stingy!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:55.800
Just kidding.

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:56.800
Here's half.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:03.020
Hey, is something like this...

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:04.980
...happiness?

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.310
Who knows?

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:10.310
I really let him have it when I broke up with him.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.230
What did you say?

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.820
"You'll definitely regret this later!"

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.940
Serves him right!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.570
Ah, I figured it out.

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:22.330
Happiness is a hot chocolate on a cold days!

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.340
What should we do?

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:37.930
There are still people around.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:39.550
It's fine. They're leaving.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:41.890
I'm sure this will become a memory.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:45.560
If we're seen by anyone, it'll become a huge fuss.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.940
Because I graduated today, I don't really care.

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:49.900
I still have another year.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:51.480
This'll only make you look even better.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.150
Is that so?

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:55.360
Hurry.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.160
The beach...

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.410
I want to go to the beach.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.450
No way. It's cold and it stinks.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.120
Let's go! Take me to the beach!

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:10.420
It's so cold!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:13.340
And it stinks like kelp! It wasn't supposed to be like this!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.290
Didn't I tell you?

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:17.670
Ah! A bug! Over here, too!

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:18.260
Gross, gross!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.590
Let's go back! Let's go back!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.800
We just got here!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.050
Let's go back! Let's go back! Let's go back!

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:24.510
Mocchan.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.560
Motoharu-kun.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:26.640
Are you mad?

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:27.430
I'm sorry.

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:32.270
I just wanted to see something beautiful.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:35.270
Then I'll take you to the southern islands one day.

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:37.360
Really? When?

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:41.660
Well, first I have to save crazy money... So about ten years, I guess?

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:42.280
You moron!

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:44.830
Stop.

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:45.990
Stop here today.

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:47.490
Why?

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:48.910
No reason.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:50.000
What the heck?

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.040
Should I get us something to drink?

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:54.920
Is coffee all right?

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:57.460
What is this?

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.630
I bumped it.

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:00.970
Are you still seeing him?

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:04.220
I only met with him.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:11.270
I said I only met with him.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.270
You're mean.

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:18.650
Kagawa, a junior is here to see you.

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:20.490
A junior?

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:25.620
Did you fall?

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:27.120
As if, you moron.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:30.500
So, did you win or lose?

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.710
Winning and losing doesn't matter in these kind of situations.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.670
I kept on punching until I was satisfied.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:37.420
Witch means you were also punched until he was satisfied.

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:43.090
Thank you.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.760
Ow! Don't touch them, you moron!

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:46.640
Hey, I wanna take a picture of this.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.390
What? Are you an idiot or something?

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:51.640
It'll be a proof that you fought for me.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.400
You're... the same.

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:57.360
As that arrogant guy.

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:01.360
You really like crying, don't you?

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:05.860
There's no human out there who likes crying.

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:08.120
That's why I'm here like this right now.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:18.670
Promise me...

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:22.340
...that you absolutely won't betray me.

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:25.630
Yeah.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:27.640
There's no second chance.

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:30.350
I promise.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:34.020
I promise.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.890
I absolutely won't betray you.

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:42.690
Ah, Motoharu?

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:43.900
Clam down and listen carefully.

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:46.990
You see... Nana-san was riding with Kagawa in his car, and...

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:12.140
Takahashi.

00:22:12.140 --> 00:22:13.720
Ah, you're up?

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:17.060
What are you doing?

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:19.610
Well, you fell asleep.

00:22:19.610 --> 00:22:22.900
Ah... sorry. I was using your bag as a pillow?

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:24.820
You should've just woken me up.

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:31.370
Well, you looked like you were having a happy dream, so I didn't want to wake you up.

00:22:31.370 --> 00:22:32.950
A happy dream?

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:33.700
Yeah.

00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:39.460
What's happiness...?

00:22:39.460 --> 00:22:41.710
I wonder what it is?

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:42.670
That's a tough one.

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:44.420
Umm...

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:45.590
Uhh...

00:22:46.970 --> 00:22:49.970
Ah! Something warm.

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:50.680
Something warm?

00:22:50.680 --> 00:22:53.310
Yeah! Like a steamed meat bun or a roasted sweet potato.

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:54.930
Something that warms you up on a cold day.

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:57.810
Something that soothes your heart.

00:22:57.810 --> 00:22:58.940
A steamed meat bun, huh?

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:01.940
Well, it can be anything, like a book you like or a CD.

00:22:58.960 --> 00:23:05.610
The sunset stretches my shadow long and thin.

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:04.400
Or someone you like.

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:10.820
Its colors deeply dye my heart

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:17.500
When you said this was probably the last time,

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:17.960
Let's go get some steamed meat buns.

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:23.920
I held back my tears.

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:20.670
It's already the season for steamed meat buns?

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:25.880
This was the first time...

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:30.930
Memories are always too sad.

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:29.840
...the first time I wished for someone else's happiness.

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:37.430
I just want to forget them all.

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:44.150
I continued to watch the last sunset

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:49.950
and your back that I would never see again.

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:57.120
The sun that slowly, slowly sets in the distance.

00:23:57.120 --> 00:24:06.170
Right now, I'm being drenched by this rain.

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:12.090
Is that all right if I cry now?

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:14.790
You're no longer here.

00:24:14.790 --> 00:24:21.230
Even if my tears begin to overflow, don't stop them.

00:24:21.230 --> 00:24:27.900
Rain, freeze me down to my heart.

00:24:27.900 --> 00:24:37.490
I just want to silently fade into nothingness.

00:24:52.760 --> 00:25:01.270
Stop the sunset. Don't sing right now.

00:25:01.270 --> 00:25:07.940
The sun casts sad colors as it sinks into the ocean.

00:25:04.910 --> 00:25:34.940
Episode 4 Preview ...

00:25:05.520 --> 00:25:07.360
Is it my imagination...

00:25:07.360 --> 00:25:11.860
...or has the person
I like seemed distant lately?

00:25:07.940 --> 00:25:14.660
Just let me stay here alone forever.

00:25:11.860 --> 00:25:15.990
Since the day we had
the steamed meat buns together.

00:25:14.660 --> 00:25:24.040
Make it so the sun never sets.

00:25:15.990 --> 00:25:19.990
You don't have to be
so protective of me like before.

00:25:19.990 --> 00:25:20.830
I don't understand...

00:25:21.580 --> 00:25:24.330
I don't understand Yano...

00:25:24.330 --> 00:25:28.710
I wonder if we'll be
able to talk like we did before...

00:25:28.710 --> 00:25:31.090
I'll tell this once, so listen carefully.

00:25:32.460 --> 00:25:34.380
I love you.
